ICA Toolkit iOS Plugin :
Tech5 AirSnap Fingerprint Plugin — camera-based fingerprint capture
using the Tech5 AirSnap SDK.

Supported architectures:
	1. arm64 (iOS device only — no simulator slice)

Contents:

  T5FingerCapture.framework
      Umbrella framework that embeds all required Tech5 SDK components:
        AirsnapFingerUI.framework  Camera capture UI
        T5AirSnapFramework         Tech5 AirSnap native SDK
        ncnn.framework             Neural network runtime
        opencv2.framework          OpenCV for fingerprint processing
        OpenSSL.framework          Cryptography
        T5NistLibrary              NIST fingerprint quality

Installation:

  1. Drag T5FingerCapture.framework into your Xcode project.
  2. Project target > General > Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content:
       - Set T5FingerCapture.framework to "Embed & Sign"
  3. Add Camera permission to Info.plist:

       <key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
       <string>Required for fingerprint capture</string>

  4. Project target > Build Settings > Other Linker Flags:
       - Add -ObjC

Requirements:

  - Minimum iOS deployment target: 14.0
  - Architecture: arm64 (device only — does not include simulator slice)
  - Camera permission required at runtime
  - Network connection (Tech5 SDK requires periodic license validation)

Notes:

  - The AirSnap SDK launches a camera capture view controller internally.
    Pass a UIViewController context (not Application context) when invoking
    the toolkit's fingerprint capture API.
  - Framework size: ~121 MB (includes ML models for fingerprint detection
    and liveness, OpenCV, NCNN runtime, NIST quality library).
  - The full xcframework set with simulator slices (446 MB total) is
    distributed separately. Contact the toolkit team if a simulator-capable
    build is needed for development.

NEW in v3.0.5.
